code,core,ui: iteration 2 — extract helpers and prune noise

- agent_run: collapse the two near-identical lifecycle-hook closures into a
  single lifecycle_hook lambda parameterized on the marker kind. Behavior
  unchanged; the surviving comment now carries only the failure-mode
  rationale (swallow append errors so a down cursor cannot take down a job).
- replay: extract track_lifecycle so outstanding_job_ids and
  outstanding_job_ids_at share the started/finished state machine instead
  of duplicating it.
- ui/tui/mod.rs: drop the meaningless `Some(_) = &app.jobs` conjunct in
  the resume reconcile guard. The reconcile is purely a lineage query;
  whether the registry exists has no bearing on whether the agent should
  be told that ids are stale.
